        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rI hope you enjoyed your vacation at Haven, because there is work to be done.\r\rTyson Williams&apos; health is deteriorating fast, and three people close to him are each angling to worm themselves into his will. Naturally, since you are already on the island, each of them has reached out to us to, shall we say, thin out the competition.\r\rJust another day in paradise, 47. I shall leave you to prepare.\r\rGood luck.",
